        "created_at": "2014-08-20T17:47:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Revo corp would have a hard time getting voss out of that other dimension nightmist sent him to&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Anything that can be sent can be returned, and anything lost can be found. &nbsp;I would be very surprised if that mist was the end of Voss. &nbsp;If the Staff was found in Revo-Corp then they had Apostate's sword, who knows what else they have access to.</p>",
