        "created_at": "2014-08-20T19:00:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh I don't think the whole Revo-Corp thing is going down in the card game. &nbsp;It is still being set up in tactics. &nbsp;Voss could be back in the card game&nbsp;<span>(I expect a promo for him),</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>I don't know how well he fits Tactics, it would be very interesting though.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I've been working on some of the villains converting them to Tactics, I might try to make a series of retro-scenarios if some good templates show up. &nbsp;Voss's Invasion is just too good a scenario to not use it. &nbsp;(have Spite half-done, but the \"play as a soul-less murderer\" scenario isn't sitting well in testing so I may bail on it)</p>",
